  "scope": "With active streaming, direct solid placement and direct replacement use the existing terrain threshold. A resident edit can write another vertical slice. The prefab holds its definition and counts unique cold XZ destinations of resolved, writable voxels before mutation when the simple voxel-count test cannot establish capacity. Refusal publishes no partial placement and leaves dirty state intact. An exact retry uses the newly available slots. Fluid placement still requires a loaded receiver. The test also exercises the nonstreamed admission path and the current limit when streaming resumes with pre-existing columns above it.",
  "remaining": "Join the pre-existing terrain handoff, deferred physics including cold material-reaction destinations, relight owners, record-only owners, the live disk index and registry. For modeled steady producers with fixed threshold T, previous resident count N0 and largest one-result generation write W, the induction bound is max(N0, T minus one plus max(1,W)). Prove the handoff and remaining producers before using it as a whole-world bound. Full S0-S6 acceptance remains open at 23 of 42 packages.",
